#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:79
msgid "Throughout this tutorial we will run simulations of alanine dipeptide in vacuum using GROMACS and PLUMED. Whereas this system is too simple to be considered a proper benchmark for enhanced sampling methods, it is complex enough to be used when learning about them. Some of the commands below are specific for GROMACS, but all the PLUMED input files are compatible with other MD engines as well."
msgstr ""

